g alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><b>Darkvision</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Can see in the dark up to a certain distance.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Ancestry\" title=\"Fey Ancestry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp/25px-Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp/38px-Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp/50px-Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fey Ancestry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp/25px-Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Fey_Ancestry_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Ancestry\" title=\"Fey Ancestry\"><b>Fey Ancestry</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Advantage on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throws</a> against being <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">charmed</a>; can't be put to <a href=\"/wiki/Sleeping_(Condition)\" title=\"Sleeping (Condition)\">sleep</a> by magic.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><b>Opportunity Attack</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attack an enemy moving out of reach.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_WYR_KillDirectorGortash_Servant_004</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_KillDirectorGortash_Servant_004+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_KillDirectorGortash_Servant_004+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>0008fbb4-88e7-44b5-b58e-6c6fe9a4a49e</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0008fbb4-88e7-44b5-b58e-6c6fe9a4a49e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0008fbb4-88e7-44b5-b58e-6c6fe9a4a49e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HalfElf_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HalfElf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HalfElf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Servant Naiske</b> is a staff member in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a> who is present for <a href=\"/wiki/Gortash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gortash\">Gortash's</a> ordination as the Archduke of the city. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>She accompanies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/38px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/50px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Madeline Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\">Lady Madeline Whitburn</a> and after the ceremony moves to the northern nave of the Audience hall. Naiske patiently forbears her mistress' constantly changing whims on refreshments she would like to try.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Idle_banter\">Idle banter</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>Naiske, bring me a plate of the cold-water pike.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Naiske</dt><dd>The cook has prepared no pike today, my lady.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>A most grievous error. In that case, fetch me a bowl of sunfish-head stew.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Naiske</dt><dd>The kitchen is fresh out of sunfish, my lady.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>Well, I <i>never</i>.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Naiske</dt><dd>If that is all, my lady -</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>Cheese. Something cut fresh from the wheel.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Naiske</dt><dd>I'll have to inquire with <a href=\"/wiki/Darlie\" title=\"Darlie\">Cook Darlie</a> about...</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>Ah, Naiske. Why must you make everything such a bother?</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>I so fancy a glass of Dragondew. Fetch me a bottle, and be quick about it.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Naiske</dt><dd>At once, my lady. Would you...</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>Ah, never you mind - a young Pink Clarry<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> would more suit the occasion. Bring it at once.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Naiske</dt><dd>Pink Clarry it is, my good lady.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Madeline Whitburn</dt><dd>Ah, but perhaps a mint wine. My palate needs cleansing. Though I've grown quite fond of Evermead...</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Likely refering to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Daggerford_clarry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daggerford Clarry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Daggerford_clarry\">Daggerford Clarry</a></span>. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-out